Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_or_fallback.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val xs = [1, 2];
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_or_fallback.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     val first = xs.first() or 0;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0045]: Jet writes the fallback as `??`, not `or`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_or_fallback.jet:3:28
    |
  3 |     val first = xs.first() or 0;
    |                            ^^
 Why: `??` supplies a value when a `T?` is absent or a `T ? E` failed — `count ?? 0`, `read() ?? return`
 Fix: replace `or` with `??`
